Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:13:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1025/1178] Artifacts: faults measured in a take or a file made
 from it

A new drawer in Post asks the lab (/lab/inspect, CPU, cached per source) for held tones
named as notes (a drone is music, a 17 kHz whine is not), the VAE's frame buzz per 30 s
(the 4-12 kHz envelope at 25..150 Hz, the 1920-sample frame), click candidates, clipping,
dropouts, DC, stereo correlation per band and loudness. Every time plays from there.
Choosing a take shows an earlier measurement at once (cached=1) and never starts one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
